piglia for E9 URBAN & CLIMBING Clothes - natural voice style by Guy Harris\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Because I see Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This is a stunning film. So when I was asked by the director Rovero Impiglia if i would like to voice it, i jumped at the chance.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/character-voices-showreel","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Character Voices Showreel","aria-label":"Previous: Character Voices Showreel","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/boov-pop-game-trailer","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Boov Pop Game Trailer","aria-label":"Next: Boov Pop Game Trailer","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>I'd seen some of Rovero Impiglia's work before and really wanted an opportunity to work with him. Great writing, great direction, and (I hope) great voiceover. I think we absolutely nailed it in just a few takes. I understood the direction he wanted to take and the music and the visuals instantly made it easy to understand the direction the voice should take. As a voiceover artist, I think I can make most scripts sound good, but good scripts help us sound so much better! This kind of inspirational <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promo video</a> can be a powerful marketing tool and I hope it gets lots of exposure. </p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5_eVJQndGD0","title":"Because I see Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/because-i-see-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Because I see Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Because I see Voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Welcome to 'Because I see'</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><em>They used to tell me that you’ll never stop learning and they were right. </em>\r\n<em>I have internalized new skills on the rock, with devotion and constancy, until they became my dance, my self-expression.</em>\r\nIt's a nice contrast to some of my other work. It's actually quite refreshing to have a chance to 'tone it down' for some thing. Personally, I think it's turned out really nice. Rovero and <a title=\"Enove official Website\" href=\"https://www.e9planet.com\" target=\"_blank\">E9 URBAN &amp; CLIMBING Clothes</a> agree.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Maybe you have a project that needs this kind of delivery? Perhaps a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>.  Please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I'm more than happy to send you a short voice a sample first to see if my voice is right for your project. Tell me more about your project and let's see what we can achieve together!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Because I see Voiceover","pageUrl":"because-i-see-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","747",{"href":"/siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice.jpg","alt":"siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Siegecraft Commander Trailer Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","929",{"href":"/virtual-voiceover-studio-online","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/virtual-voiceover-studio-online.jpg","alt":"virtual-voiceover-studio-online","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Virtual Voiceover Studio"}]]}],["$","$L3","570",{"href":"/rac-car-passport-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/rac-car-passport.jpg","alt":"RAC Car Passport Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"RAC Car Passport Voiceover"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7